# BigWigsMods/packager config. Project IDs are in DwarfExplorersBible.toc (## X-Curse-Project-ID / ## X-Wago-ID).
package-as: DwarfExplorersBible

ignore:
  - tests
  - tools
  - .luacheckrc
  - media/logo.png
  - media/screenshots

manual-changelog:
  filename: CHANGELOG.md
  markup-type: markdown
